132 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 109 0 R
/E (Gymnasium AI Agent is a multi-agent AI-powered fitness assistant designed to help users manage workouts, track progress, and receive personalized exercise guidance through natural language interaction. The system leverages a multi-agent architecture, where a central \(root\) agent coordinates with a specialized Gym Coach agent to understand user intent and execute tasks. These tasks are carried out using integrated tools via the Model Context Protocol \(MCP\), enabling real-time actions such as logging workouts, tracking fitness progress, and retrieving historical data.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
